      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KLIMENKO (3) turned in a moderate run last time when sixth at The Gardens over 400m behind Mighty Henry (23.48) in a Grade 5. Key runner on her best form. SUDDEN SURPRISE (4) was a strong winner (16.20) from box 6 last time, scoring by 2.5 lengths at The Gardens. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. PITMAN GO WELL (1) is super consistent overall, having placed 26 of 50 career runs. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (22.37) at this track. Has a good record here including four wins. The form from his last run stacks up well. Expected to feature again. GRAND ARTIST (2) cannot be underestimated.",
